///////////MIRKWOOD//////////////
/////////////////////////////////

SCRIPT:mgfotr_gloin001
"The last time I was in the company of elves, the experience was notably less enjoyable."
END

SCRIPT:mgfotr_gloin002
"When I travelled with Thorin and your uncle, we crossed that blighted forest... Mirkwood. Hungry, thirsty. In need of aid..."
END

SCRIPT:mgfotr_gloin003
"Gloin: And that was it. With the vanishing of the Feast, we were lost, wandering in the endless dark, \n until one by one, we were taken by the horrors of the forest... all, but your brave uncle Bilbo."
END

SCRIPT:mgfotr_gloin004
"Gloin: So we languished in the dungeons of the Elvenking, until your uncle hatched a plan to get us out."
END

SCRIPT:mgfotr_gloin005
"Gloin: Tell you the truth, I wasn't looking forward to being in the company of Elves again... but these \n folk aren't near as uppity as Thranduil's subjects. Proper manners, and they haven't thrown me in a cell yet."
END

SCRIPT:mgfotr_gloin006
"Would that I could share your outlook, boy. This gloom... it suffocates!"
END

SCRIPT:mgfotr_thorin001
"Thorin: The Elves won't take kindly to our presence here. But we are starving, and we need food."
END

SCRIPT:mgfotr_thorin003
"Curse this damned forest."
END

SCRIPT:mgfotr_thorin004
"All of you, gather around. This isn't over yet!"
END

SCRIPT:mgfotr_thorin005
"I hear them! They are coming!"
END

SCRIPT:mgfotr_thorin006
"Khazad! Khazad ai-menu!"
END

SCRIPT:mgfotr_thorin007
"Kill them all!"
END

SCRIPT:mgfotr_thorin008
"Slash its legs!"
END

SCRIPT:mgfotr_thorin009
"You should not have crossed the sons of Durin!"
END

SCRIPT:mgfotr_thorin010
"Vile creatures! Kill them all!"
END

SCRIPT:mgfotr_thorin011
"More are coming! Hold fast!"
END

SCRIPT:mgfotr_thorin012
"A dark magic lies upon this forest."
END

SCRIPT:mgfotr_thorin013
"Well done master Baggins!"
END

SCRIPT:mgfotr_thorin014
"This way! Follow me!"
END

SCRIPT:mgfotr_thorin015
"Kili!"
END

SCRIPT:mgfotr_thorin016
"Thorin: Close ranks!"
END

SCRIPT:mgfotr_thorin017
"Thorin: Our business is no concern of elves."
END

SCRIPT:mgfotr_dwalin008
"Dwalin: Bilbo, you are our burglar. See if you can't... 'borrow' some."
END

SCRIPT:mgfotr_dwalin009
"Dwalin: Aye, master Hobbit. Unless you'd rather starve?"
END

SCRIPT:mgfotr_dwalin010
"It's just a bunch of tightly packed trees."
END

SCRIPT:mgfotr_dwalin011
"Filthy creatures! Where are you hiding!?"
END

SCRIPT:mgfotr_dwalin012
"Come then, wretches!"
END

SCRIPT:mgfotr_dwalin013
"I'll tear you to pieces!"
END

SCRIPT:mgfotr_dwalin014
"You face a son of Fundin!"
END

SCRIPT:mgfotr_dwalin015
"Ori! Watch out!"
END

SCRIPT:mgfotr_dwalin016
"Master Baggins! Get behind me!"
END

SCRIPT:mgfotr_dwalin017
"Come on, Balin. You can take that one!"
END

SCRIPT:mgfotr_kili001
"Of course we will."
END

SCRIPT:mgfotr_kili002
"Oh, Bilbo!"
END

SCRIPT:mgfotr_kili003
"Bring it on!"
END

SCRIPT:mgfotr_kili004
"I'm not scared of a little spider!"
END

SCRIPT:mgfotr_kili005
"Thorin and Dwalin are still missing!"
End

SCRIPT:mgfotr_fili001
"Do not worry, uncle. Before long, we will be restored to our rightful place."
END

SCRIPT:mgfotr_fili002
"A brave display, my friend!"
END

SCRIPT:mgfotr_fili003
"This is your end, foul thing!"
END

SCRIPT:mgfotr_fili004
"Don't get cocky now, brother!"
END

SCRIPT:mgfotr_fili005
"Keep searching! They cannot be far from here."
End


SCRIPT:mgfotr_balin019
"If we make it out of this forest alive."
END

SCRIPT:mgfotr_balin020
"Thank you, laddy. That would have been a grim end, indeed."
END

SCRIPT:mgfotr_balin021
"They are an endless tide!"
END

SCRIPT:mgfotr_balin022
"Is there no end to these vile creatures!?"
END

SCRIPT:mgfotr_balin023
"Brother! A hand, if you would!?"
END

SCRIPT:mgfotr_balin024
"I never knew spiders could get half this big!"
END


SCRIPT:mgfotr_balin025
"Stay close to me, laddie. I'll keep you safe."
End

SCRIPT:mgfotr_balin027
"Then we must hurry! Come on!"
End

SCRIPT:mgfotr_balin028
"Are you alright son?"
End

SCRIPT:mgfotr_balin029
"Look out!"
End

SCRIPT:mgfotr_balin030
"Ambush!"
